cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "agent-reliability-eval-data: QA'd test units for news-credibility agent evaluation"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "ISOC-IL Labs"
repository-code: "https://github.com/isoc-il-labs/agent-reliability-eval-data"
abstract: >-
  The dataset behind agent-reliability-eval: 44 QA'd synthetic news-article test
  units (and a 68-track raw transparency set) with committed ground-truth labels
  across six credibility dimensions, in English and Hebrew. Includes the frozen
  HTML fixtures, the 26 generation seeds, a per-asset language/model provenance
  manifest, and the label rubric. Real-outlet articles are referenced by URL only
  (HTML not redistributed). The evaluation harness lives in the separate
  agent-reliability-eval project.
keywords:
  - benchmark
  - dataset
  - agent-evaluation
  - news-credibility
  - misinformation
  - llm-eval
  - hebrew
